msgid "Dynamic Steering Ratio (Macan)"
msgstr "动态转向比（Macan）"

msgid "Dynamic Steering Ratio (Macan): speed-dependent steering ratio - 15.0 below 140 km/h, 18.7 above 145 km/h (linear transition 140-145), fitted from 29,284 samples across the full 4f route (RMSE 1.75 deg), plus torque friction 0.52. When disabled, uses stock fixed 16.2. Replaces the old experimental 18.0 (discarded: 22% gyro spread, 15% oversteer in city corners)."
msgstr "Macan 动态转向比：速度相关转向比——低于140km/h用15.0，高于145km/h用18.7（140-145线性过渡），基于4f全段29284样本拟合（RMSE 1.75°），附带扭矩摩擦补偿0.52。关闭时使用原厂固定16.2。取代旧实验值18.0（已弃用：gyro极差22%，城市弯转向不足15%）。"

msgid "Macan Dynamic Steering Ratio"
msgstr "Macan 动态转向比"

msgid "Macan Slope Compensation"
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿"

msgid "Macan Slope Comp Unlimited"
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿放开限制"

msgid "Macan Steering Params"
msgstr "Macan 转向系数"

msgid "Macan Slope Compensation: when enabled, the IMU slope signal adds g*sin(slope) to the acceleration request - more torque uphill, and a brake tap downhill (prevents forward lurch). Default off = stock behavior. Onroad cycle restart is requested after toggling."
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿：启用后，IMU 坡度信号会将 g*sin(坡度) 叠加到加速度请求上——上坡增加力矩，下坡轻点刹车（防止惯性前冲）。默认关闭=原厂行为。切换后请求重新启动 onroad 周期。"

msgid "Macan Slope Comp Unlimited (sub-option): when Slope Compensation is ON, this removes the stock torque cap (option 2: min(max(stock_mom, 200))), giving small slopes room to act. When OFF, the stock cap applies (option 1: min(stock_mom))."
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿放开限制（子选项）：当坡度补偿开启时，本选项移除原厂力矩上限（选项2：min(max(stock_mom,200))），给小坡度留出作用空间。关闭时应用原厂上限（选项1：min(stock_mom)）。"

msgid "Macan Steering Params (experimental): when enabled, uses calibrated steerRatio 18.0 / friction 0.52 instead of stock values. Calibration shows 22% cross-route spread and latAccelFactor data is insufficient, so this is EXPERIMENTAL - keep off until field data confirms."
msgstr "Macan 转向系数（实验性）：启用后使用标定值 steerRatio 18.0 / friction 0.52 替代原厂值。标定显示跨路线差异 22%，且 latAccelFactor 数据不足，因此这是实验功能——请保持关闭，直到路测数据确认。"

msgid "Select the version of Torque Control Tune to use."
msgstr "选择要使用的扭矩控制调校版本。"

msgid "Macan Accel Limit (m/s^2)"
msgstr "Macan加速度上限（m/s^2）"

msgid "Macan Accel Deadzone (m/s^2)"
msgstr "Macan加速度死区（m/s^2）"

msgid "Radar Fusion (Macan)"
msgstr "Macan雷达融合"

msgid "Macan Accel Limit: clamps the acceleration request magnitude (m/s^2). 0 = factory curve."
msgstr "Macan加速度上限：限制加速度请求幅度（m/s^2）。0=原厂曲线。"

msgid "Macan Accel Deadzone: zeroes aTarget inside +/- this value to filter MPC jitter (m/s^2). 0 = off."
msgstr "Macan加速度死区：aTarget在±该值内归零以滤除MPC抖动（m/s^2）。0=关闭。"

msgid "Radar Fusion (Macan): uses the stock ACC radar (bus2 distance + lead speed) to correct the vision lead, reduces follow jitter."
msgstr "Macan雷达融合：用原厂ACC雷达（bus2距离+前车速度）修正视觉前车，减轻跟车抖动。"

msgid "Macan Accel Deadzone Enable"
msgstr "Macan加速度死区开关"

msgid "Macan Accel Deadzone Enable: master switch. Off = deadzone fully disabled (value kept but ignored)."
msgstr "Macan加速度死区总开关：关=死区完全不生效（数值保留但被忽略）。"

msgid "Macan Accel Jerk Limit: limits how fast the acceleration request can change (m/s^3). Lower = smoother (gentler transitions, less surge); higher = more responsive. 0 = off (no limit). Decel (braking) is allowed 2.2x faster for safety. Takes effect within 1s."
msgstr "Macan加速度变化率限制：限制加速度请求的变化速率（m/s^3）。越小=越平顺（过渡更柔和，不冲）；越大=响应更快。0=关闭（不限）。刹车（减速）为安全允许2.2倍更快。1秒内生效。"
